    {
      "id": "mobile-content",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 125,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "React Native + Expo\nSDK 53\n\n• Onboarding Wizard\n• Recovery Dashboard\n• Workout Plan\n• Active Workout Logger\n• Trends & Charts\n• NativeWind Styling\n• Health Connect API\n• Zustand State",
