      "type": "text",
      "x": 740,
      "y": 125,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "Core Engine (Python)\n\n• HRV Z-Score\n• Sleep Score\n• ACWR Computation\n• EWMA Workloads\n\nML Engine:\n• PyTorch ReadinessNet\n• Anomaly Detection\n• Injury Risk Scoring\n• HRV Forecasting\n\nNLP Pipeline:\n• Sentiment Analysis\n• Goal Parsing\n• Muscle Extraction",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
