      "x": 360,
      "y": 475,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "Storage Engine (Dual Backend)\n\nIn-Memory Store:\n• 7 data types (users, baselines,\n  recovery_logs, workouts, etc.)\n• JSON file persistence\n\nSupabase Postgres:\n• 8 tables with RLS\n• 15+ indexes\n• Connection pooling",
