      "height": 150,
      "text": "82 Exercises (free-exercise-db)\n\n• 19 muscle groups\n• 4 equipment types\n• GIF demonstrations\n• Axial load ratings\n\nVector Search:\n• Qdrant in-memory\n• Semantic similarity\n• Cosine fallback\n\nFiltering:\n• Equipment, muscles, category",
